stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Pending : Order paid, seller share recorded (earning_pending)
  Pending --> Available : Cron after market.earning_hold_days, no pending refund (earning_release)
  Pending --> Reversed : Admin approves refund (earning_reversal)
  Available --> Reversed : Admin approves refund, balance still enough (earning_reversal)
  Available --> Locked : Seller requests withdrawal (withdrawal_hold)
  Locked --> Available : Seller cancels / Admin rejects (withdrawal_release)
  Locked --> Paid : Admin transfers and marks paid (withdrawal_paid)
  Paid --> [*]
  Reversed --> [*]
  note right of Pending
    Wallet.earningPendingVnd
  end note
  note right of Available
    Wallet.earningAvailableVnd
  end note
  note right of Locked
    Wallet.earningLockedVnd
  end note
